                    <th style="width: 20%;">e-form</th>
                    <th style="width: 80%;">Description</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Resume Studies</td>
                    <td>To resume studies and activate students' account (After taking off for one semester)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Semester Withdrawal</td>
                    <td>Students cannot withdraw for more than two consecutive semesters or three non-consecutive semesters.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Credit Transfer Policy</td>
                    <td>Those who do not resume their studies after two consecutive semesters, or three non-consecutive semesters will be dismissed.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td></td>
                    <td><strong>Credit Transfer Policy:</strong>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Courses obtained more than five years will not be accepted.</li>
                            <li>Only courses with C or above are transferable to Alfaisal University.</li>
                            <li>A maximum of 40% of any program total credits will be transferred.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>e-form</td>
                    <td>Grade Modification Request Form-V2</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Incomplete Grade and Extension</td>
                    <td>Must be submitted before the end of the 1st week of the Semester beginning.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Grade Appeal</td>
                    <td>To be submitted by <span data-field="faculty_role">{{ faculty_role }}</span> in case of grade entry error or make up exam</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Independent Study</td>
                    <td>Incomplete grade may be considered in case of illness or other circumstances</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Direct Study</td>
                    <td>The form will be used during <span data-field="period">{{ period }}</span> only</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Scholarship</td>
                    <td>*Disclaimer - Applying for this scholarship does not necessarily mean being awarded. Scholarships seats and funds are limited.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Confirmation of Enrollment Tracks / Minors COE</td>
                    <td>Important notes:
                        <ul>
                            <li>Completion of a track or a minor will be recognized in the transcript alongside the main major. Tracks and minors will not be recognized in diplomas.</li>
                            <li>Students are expected to review and discuss track/minor requirements with their academic advisors prior to submitting this e-form.</li>
                            <li>Pursuing a minor requires the approval of the academic advisor and department chairs.</li>
                            <li>The student should complete the main degree requirements before starting the minor.</li>
                            <li>Refer to list of courses and additional requirements for tracks and minors by visiting the department's website.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Course Drop</td>
                    <td>During Drop period only based on the University Academic Calendar. Dropped courses will not appear on a student's transcript, it will not affect the GPA, and no financial obligations.</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">REVISED: {{ revision_date }}</p>
            <div class="footer">Page 7</div>
        </div>
    </div>


<div class="page">
  <h1>College of Engineering</h1>
  <p>Academic services for Engineering students are available through <a href="{{ eforms_link }}">{{ eforms_link_text }}</a>.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 5px;">Absent Leave</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Student is responsible for providing satisfactory evidence to the instructor concerning the reason for absence. They are allowed <span data-field="absent_leave_percentage_1">{{ absent_leave_percentage_1 }}</span> and <span data-field="absent_leave_percentage_2">{{ absent_leave_percentage_2 }}</span>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 5px;">Academic Advising</h2>
    <p>Share your concern with your Academic Advisor, discuss your study plan, progress, and related academic issues.</p>
    <p>List of advisors are found here: <a href="{{ academic_advisors_link }}">{{ academic_advisors_link_text }}</a></p>
    <p><strong>CoE Registration Helpdesk:</strong></p>
    <p>Issues such as (Full classes, conflicts)</p>
    <p>List of CoE Faculty & Staff can be found <a href="{{ faculty_staff_link }}">{{ faculty_staff_link_text }}</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 5px;">Certificate Borrowing Agreement</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Student should return high school certificate(s) to The Deanship of Student Affairs after two weeks from the date of borrowing.</li>
        <li>In case student didn't return the certificate(s), will take the full responsibility for any financial liabilities.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 300px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; float: right;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span data-field="page_number">{{ page_number }}</span>
        <div>
          <button>&#9664;</button>
          <button>&#9654;</button>
          <button>&#8942;</button>
          <button>&#8617;</button>
          <button>&#8618;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">College of Engineering</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <p>Home / Departments / College of Engineering</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <label for="form_filter" style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">Form</label>
        <input type="text" id="form_filter" placeholder="Filter Form" style="width: 100%; padding: 5px;">
      </div>
      <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>#</th>
            <th>Form Title</th>
          </tr>
